              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "The id of the credit."
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Marks a credit as having a remote error by setting the `remoteErroredAt`\ntimestamp and `remoteError` message. Optionally sets a `remoteId`. This\nclears any existing `confirmedAt` timestamp.\n\n**Note**: When providing an error, please provide a clear error message\nthat the user can understand.\n"
        },
